WEBVTT

01:01.780 --> 01:02.600
Forget it.

01:03.240 --> 01:04.730
Let's just say I owe them.

02:37.000 --> 02:43.440
[Archives: The Nanyang Mystery]

02:43.880 --> 02:46.470
[Episode 29]

02:48.650 --> 02:53.300
[Feikun Palu Temple]

03:38.900 --> 03:40.579
The auspicious time has come.

03:40.810 --> 03:42.590
Great Feikun Balu,

03:42.590 --> 03:44.780
please accept your bride.

03:47.400 --> 03:48.560
Why is it a man?

03:50.710 --> 03:52.010
Never seen someone big-boned?

03:52.010 --> 03:53.480
You are not part of the clan.

03:53.480 --> 03:54.540
Where is the bride?

03:54.780 --> 03:56.010
Where is she?

03:56.310 --> 03:57.740
I am the bride.

04:06.970 --> 04:09.180
I am thousands of times better than her.

04:09.400 --> 04:09.970
Tell me.

04:10.590 --> 04:12.120
Where is my divine husband?

05:13.660 --> 05:14.160
Gosh...

07:02.720 --> 07:04.160
Attack their limbs!

07:44.420 --> 07:46.110
We have to kill the big one.

07:55.220 --> 07:55.890
If it were the chief,

07:55.890 --> 07:56.820
what would he do?

08:06.240 --> 08:07.400
I can at least borrow this, right?

08:07.400 --> 08:08.130
Hand it over!

08:11.370 --> 08:12.860
So what I picked up wasn't trash

08:12.860 --> 08:14.190
but the chief's weapon.

08:18.360 --> 08:20.560
I can't just have an arrow without a bow.

08:26.110 --> 08:27.640
Whatever, I'll just try it.

09:05.480 --> 09:06.400
Useless thing.

09:27.050 --> 09:27.910
Zhang Qianjun!

09:28.390 --> 09:29.410
You have no sense of direction!

09:29.410 --> 09:30.740
Who are you to be a guide?

09:32.180 --> 09:33.640
What's with all the noise?

09:35.920 --> 09:37.650
S-Sorry for intruding.

09:45.460 --> 09:46.320
Zhang Qianjun!

09:46.330 --> 09:47.060
The bow!

09:48.720 --> 09:49.360
What?

09:49.870 --> 09:50.670
The bow!

10:11.980 --> 10:13.770
Feikun Balu?

10:15.260 --> 10:16.780
Feikun Balu?

10:18.330 --> 10:19.610
Feikun Balu!

10:39.670 --> 10:40.990
What a piece of work.

10:57.960 --> 10:59.020
Lend me some blood.

11:00.770 --> 11:02.260
H-How do I give it to you?

11:03.780 --> 11:04.530
Watch out!

11:50.510 --> 11:52.200
Having so much fun without me?

12:00.860 --> 12:01.840
Bastard,

12:01.890 --> 12:03.420
I'll kill you!

12:16.090 --> 12:17.420
What's with the outfit?

12:19.310 --> 12:20.580
I got married in my spare time,

12:20.580 --> 12:21.910
and the groom is a loser.

12:22.770 --> 12:24.670
You have pretty terrible taste then.

12:24.670 --> 12:26.200
You picked the ugliest one.

12:36.340 --> 12:37.660
This is the bow left by the chief.

12:37.660 --> 12:39.590
Shoot its weak spot, and it'll die.

13:08.410 --> 13:09.210
Zhang Hailou!

13:09.950 --> 13:10.980
Zhang Qianjun!

13:27.290 --> 13:27.890
Shrimpie!

13:30.240 --> 13:30.840
Shrimpie!

13:38.150 --> 13:39.550
Aren't you the one going?

13:40.160 --> 13:41.050
You go.

13:43.730 --> 13:44.190
Well...

13:44.190 --> 13:45.410
it's better if we go together.

13:45.410 --> 13:47.040
My leg hasn't fully healed yet.

13:47.040 --> 13:48.090
What if I die?

13:51.560 --> 13:52.890
What if I die?

13:58.820 --> 14:00.490
Then I'll give you a grand funeral.

14:00.490 --> 14:02.420
Then I'll give you a grand funeral.

14:07.130 --> 14:07.710
Fine.

15:11.940 --> 15:13.000
Because right now,

15:13.220 --> 15:14.320
if he thinks

15:14.340 --> 15:16.300
he can still be with you like before,

15:16.300 --> 15:17.640
the good in him

15:18.930 --> 15:20.150
still has a reason to survive.

15:20.150 --> 15:22.170
But if you've already started to hate him,

15:22.170 --> 15:23.770
or if he comes to believe that

15:23.820 --> 15:24.600
the good in him

15:24.600 --> 15:26.370
is hopeless,

15:27.430 --> 15:30.090
then that goodness
will disappear completely.

15:30.800 --> 15:33.000
He will become an evil spirit from hell.

15:34.550 --> 15:35.170
So,

15:36.250 --> 15:38.110
you must act as if nothing

15:38.940 --> 15:40.330
has happened.

16:14.980 --> 16:15.550
What are you doing?

16:15.550 --> 16:16.550
Get out of the way!

16:21.120 --> 16:22.600
She tried to kill me first.

16:22.750 --> 16:23.680
Why did you...

16:24.220 --> 16:24.980
Who is this?

16:25.370 --> 16:29.170
-My enemy who wiped out Phoenix Fortress!
-My bro from the Archives.

16:34.550 --> 16:36.140
I will make you pay in blood!

16:39.270 --> 16:40.610
That didn't kill it?

16:42.290 --> 16:42.890
Shrimpie!

16:55.510 --> 16:56.100
Come out!

16:57.600 --> 16:59.460
Come out and fight me one-on-one!

17:37.660 --> 17:38.320
Brother?

17:40.180 --> 17:41.410
Why are you here?

17:45.270 --> 17:46.500
It's probably because
when the priest

17:46.500 --> 17:47.940
was collecting corpses,

17:47.960 --> 17:50.560
he brought
Great Golden Blade's remains here.

18:13.710 --> 18:15.110
They can protect themselves.

18:15.110 --> 18:16.920
The tricky one is here with us.

18:17.720 --> 18:19.140
This thing already has
its vital point blown out.

18:19.140 --> 18:20.270
Why isn't it dead?

18:20.570 --> 18:22.200
This seems to be a female snake.

18:22.200 --> 18:24.310
A female snake's vital point
is different from other snakes'.

18:24.310 --> 18:25.010
Find it

18:25.660 --> 18:26.520
and destroy it.

18:34.470 --> 18:35.070
I'll do it.

18:52.220 --> 18:53.280
What are you doing?

18:56.180 --> 18:57.110
What should we do?

18:57.110 --> 18:59.450
Pull the black-haired snake
out of its limbs.

18:59.450 --> 19:00.860
The female snake
will naturally spit it out

19:00.860 --> 19:02.920
when it's unable to control its body.

19:03.510 --> 19:05.210
Sorry, bro.

21:07.460 --> 21:08.200
Shrimpie!

21:08.510 --> 21:09.220
Shrimpie!

21:09.700 --> 21:10.310
Shrimpie!

21:20.740 --> 21:21.460
Shrimpie!

21:22.480 --> 21:23.430
Shrimpie!

21:24.850 --> 21:25.530
Shrimpie.

21:38.940 --> 21:40.470
Am I going to die here today?

21:47.310 --> 21:48.210
Shrimpie!

22:13.680 --> 22:14.680
Hope this works.

22:15.700 --> 22:16.700
Hopefully...

22:28.220 --> 22:29.020
Zhang Hailou!

22:29.980 --> 22:30.900
Shoot!

22:32.240 --> 22:33.100
It's Shrimpie.

23:01.770 --> 23:02.420
Shrimpie.

23:04.070 --> 23:04.810
Shrimpie!

23:06.740 --> 23:07.420
Shrimpie.

23:22.870 --> 23:24.200
I thought you were dead.

23:32.880 --> 23:34.280
I had to dodge your blood.

23:47.010 --> 23:47.810
What's wrong?

24:06.720 --> 24:07.520
I'm too tired.

24:08.400 --> 24:09.590
I originally thought
my 10 years in Nanyang

24:09.590 --> 24:11.200
was already the limit.

24:17.270 --> 24:19.770
Why did you pick
such an ugly piece of clothing?

24:19.770 --> 24:21.970
It's better than the last one, isn't it?

24:23.250 --> 24:23.720
I didn't expect it to be even more tiring

24:23.720 --> 24:25.580
after returning to the Archives.

24:27.720 --> 24:29.610
Why can my arrow track your blood?

24:29.860 --> 24:31.260
The tattoos on our bodies

24:31.310 --> 24:32.910
appear when our blood is hot.

24:33.330 --> 24:35.480
Although we got tattoos
and became members of the Zhang family,

24:35.480 --> 24:37.050
we got different Qiongqi tattoos

24:37.050 --> 24:38.510
and used different herbs.

24:38.940 --> 24:39.790
Over time,

24:39.790 --> 24:41.030
it will also affect our respective bodies

24:41.030 --> 24:42.040
and blood.

24:42.720 --> 24:43.590
Simply put,

24:43.590 --> 24:44.770
the herbs turned your blood

24:44.770 --> 24:45.760
into Yang blood

24:45.940 --> 24:48.010
and mine into Yin blood.

24:49.290 --> 24:51.050
And because of
a certain substance in the herbs,

24:51.050 --> 24:53.710
these two types of blood
can attract each other.

24:54.400 --> 24:55.420
And that bow probably

24:55.420 --> 24:56.530
used the blood of the Zhang family

24:56.530 --> 24:57.440
to attack.

24:57.660 --> 24:59.660
The chief probably also has Yang blood,

24:59.660 --> 25:01.460
which is why you can use that bow.

25:08.900 --> 25:11.030
And Mentor wants me to be the Director?

25:11.110 --> 25:12.640
You should be the Director.

25:12.920 --> 25:14.070
My knowledge of the Archives

25:14.070 --> 25:15.800
is not even one-tenth of yours.

25:21.080 --> 25:21.810
Actually, I was only

25:21.810 --> 25:23.470
10% sure we could win just now.

25:24.590 --> 25:25.990
I was just giving it a try.

25:29.160 --> 25:30.570
The Zhang family is really ruthless,

25:30.570 --> 25:32.230
inventing a weapon like this.

25:32.250 --> 25:33.350
With that weapon,

25:33.570 --> 25:35.700
you killing me would be a piece of cake.

25:39.850 --> 25:41.740
If I get hurt, even just a little bit,

25:41.740 --> 25:43.330
you can kill me very easily.

25:55.460 --> 25:56.320
You were right.

25:57.790 --> 25:58.860
About what?

25:59.420 --> 26:01.480
Didn't you ask me before if I was sick?

26:03.200 --> 26:05.400
Something is indeed wrong with my body.

26:10.570 --> 26:12.380
But I've made peace with myself.

26:18.570 --> 26:19.290
Shrimpie.

26:20.350 --> 26:21.200
It's okay.

26:22.270 --> 26:23.220
If you are sick,

26:23.260 --> 26:24.720
we can just get it treated.

26:26.900 --> 26:28.630
I think I'm fine the way I am now.

26:30.270 --> 26:32.400
I also know why you used to be so strong.

26:33.680 --> 26:35.540
Because once you start fighting,

26:35.830 --> 26:37.630
you don't care if you live or die,

26:37.920 --> 26:39.120
or about anyone else.

26:45.180 --> 26:46.350
Now I can do it too.

26:49.420 --> 26:50.900
It feels pretty good.

26:54.180 --> 26:55.310
I am very happy now.

26:56.440 --> 26:57.110
Shrimpie.

27:00.810 --> 27:01.610
Let's get you treated.

27:01.610 --> 27:03.150
I killed people. You saw it.

27:03.180 --> 27:03.810
I know.

27:03.850 --> 27:05.650
Curing me won't bring them back.

27:27.060 --> 27:28.390
You have no idea

27:28.440 --> 27:29.420
what I've done.

27:36.000 --> 27:36.690
All right.

27:38.810 --> 27:39.810
Come with me then.

27:42.790 --> 27:44.750
I'll show you something good.

28:37.270 --> 28:38.590
Will you kill me?

29:46.770 --> 29:48.240
I killed all of them.

29:50.490 --> 29:51.640
Don't you care?

30:56.790 --> 30:58.520
Didn't you say you didn't care?

31:04.460 --> 31:05.920
Your expression right now

31:07.940 --> 31:09.250
says otherwise.

31:52.570 --> 31:53.970
You are just like Mentor.

31:54.810 --> 31:57.010
You say you don't care what I've become,

31:58.340 --> 32:01.140
but actually,
you can't accept me like this at all.

32:04.160 --> 32:05.310
You saw Mentor?

32:07.740 --> 32:08.780
Come out.

32:20.420 --> 32:21.400
Mentor.

32:32.680 --> 32:34.680
You've been following me all along.

32:35.590 --> 32:36.940
What do you want?

32:47.110 --> 32:48.330
Just kill me.

32:49.980 --> 32:52.690
Didn't you say you'd handle it yourself?

32:54.140 --> 32:54.940
Mentor,

33:01.370 --> 33:02.450
I thought I could.

33:04.660 --> 33:05.810
But I can't.

33:08.070 --> 33:09.350
I want to kill people.

33:10.920 --> 33:12.310
I can't control myself.

33:14.810 --> 33:16.530
I'm really going crazy.

33:27.140 --> 33:29.070
If I had known it would be like this,

33:31.030 --> 33:33.290
you might as well have killed me that day.

33:36.570 --> 33:38.430
At least I could have died at home.

34:03.340 --> 34:04.990
These things

34:05.920 --> 34:07.680
can be made into a medicine.

34:11.820 --> 34:13.350
It can stabilize your mind.

34:30.380 --> 34:32.360
So it's because of this medicine

34:34.760 --> 34:36.340
that you became like this?

34:40.030 --> 34:41.690
Go make the medicine quickly,

34:42.770 --> 34:44.270
and end all of this.

35:36.050 --> 35:38.310
The medicine Mentor traded her life for,

35:38.320 --> 35:39.720
I burned it in front of her

35:40.000 --> 35:41.360
with my own hands.

35:43.000 --> 35:44.900
Mentor's expression—

35:46.570 --> 35:47.780
she looked so sad,

35:49.130 --> 35:50.800
but it was so amusing to me.

35:57.770 --> 36:00.300
It would have been great
if you were there too.

36:10.010 --> 36:10.880
Zhang Haixia,

36:12.770 --> 36:14.180
you're crazy!

36:22.780 --> 36:24.500
Didn't you know that already?
